shipper [VERSION] — resumable, evidence-backed publishing for Rust workspaces

Start here, in this order:
  shipper doctor      check auth, git, tooling, and registry reachability
  shipper plan        preview the deterministic publish order
  shipper preflight   prove the release can finish before anything uploads
  shipper publish     execute the plan — rerun (or `shipper resume`) to continue

Usage: shipper [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Run `shipper --help` for every command, or `shipper <command> --help` for one.
